npm/README.md:134:- **Codex is not bundled — the pair-rail is inert until you install it.** The cross-model review rail invokes the [Codex CLI](https://github.com/openai/codex), which is **not** shipped with this framework. On a fresh install with no Codex present, the pair-rail **fails open and contributes zero review** — protected-path edits still pass the GPG ceremony, but no second model looks at them. You only get the cross-model rung after installing Codex separately. See [`docs/HONEST-LIMITATIONS.md`](docs/HONEST-LIMITATIONS.md) and ADR-145.
