  1618	# ---- 6a. PLAN-153 Wave E item 3: coarse credential-read deny baseline ----
  1619	#
  1620	# Injects a small permissions.deny baseline into the settings.json THIS
  1621	# install run just produced.
  1622	#
  1623	# HONEST FRAMING (never sold as coverage): this is a coarse harness
  1624	# backstop. Claude Code Read deny rules cover the built-in file tools and
  1625	# the file commands the harness recognizes inside Bash (cat/head/tail/sed),
  1626	# but NOT arbitrary subprocesses that open files themselves; Bash pattern
  1627	# rules are trivially bypassable by rephrasing. The pipe-to-shell class is
  1628	# OWNED by check_bash_safety.py's parse gate — the single
  1629	# "Bash(curl * | bash)" entry here is a tripwire, not the rail.
  1630	# Scope, residuals, and opt-out: docs/deny-baseline.md.
  1631	#
  1632	# Exclusion note (ratified fallback): Claude Code evaluates deny before
  1633	# allow and "a deny rule can't carry allowlist exceptions", so
  1634	# "deny **/.env.* except .env.example" is NOT expressible via deny+allow.
  1635	# We therefore deny SPECIFIC sensitive .env variants only; .env.example /
  1636	# .env.sample / .env.template stay readable because they are simply not
  1637	# listed. Residual: unlisted variants (e.g. .env.secret) pass the backstop.
  1638	#
  1639	# Idempotency: runs ONLY when this run created settings.json
  1640	# (SETTINGS_PRE_EXISTING=0). Re-running install skips settings.json
  1641	# entirely, so removed entries are never re-added. The merge itself is
  1642	# also order-preserving + deduplicating, so even a forced re-apply cannot
  1643	# duplicate entries.
  1644	#
  1645	# Fail-open on infrastructure (house rule): if neither jq nor python3 is
  1646	# available, or the merge fails, WARN with manual instructions and leave
  1647	# the just-copied settings.json untouched.
  1648	#
  1649	# Opt-out: CEO_INSTALL_SKIP_DENY_BASELINE=1 (mirrors CEO_INSTALL_SKIP_SELF_SHA).
  1650	
  1651	DENY_BASELINE_ENTRIES=(
  1652	  "Read(~/.ssh/**)"
  1653	  "Read(~/.aws/**)"
  1654	  "Read(~/.npmrc)"
  1655	  "Read(~/.config/gcloud/**)"
  1656	  "Read(~/.kube/config)"
  1657	  "Read(~/.docker/config.json)"
  1658	  "Read(~/.git-credentials)"
  1659	  "Read(~/.netrc)"
  1660	  "Read(~/.pypirc)"
