A concrete mainline defect surfaced: the parity oracle explicitly allowlists a “REAL install-only delivery gap” for `.gitignore`. A v1.2.0 adopter receives `/night-mode` on upgrade but never receives the ignore rules, so arming it creates commit-eligible permission posture files despite the release claim that they are gitignored. This is outside the four signed exceptions.
